cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If TrainKernel contributes to your work, please cite this repository and release.
title: "TrainKernel: A static PyTorch training-step compiler for NVIDIA GPUs"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Somu
    given-names: Arya
repository-code: https://github.com/arpjw/trainkernel
url: https://github.com/arpjw/trainkernel
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-26
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - PyTorch
  - CUDA
  - compiler
  - training
  - megakernel
abstract: >-
  TrainKernel compiles a supported static functional PyTorch training step,
  including forward, loss, gradients, and SGD update, into one cooperative
  CUDA kernel for NVIDIA SM80 and newer GPUs, with measured A100 and H100
  evidence and an experimental SM90a WGMMA backend.
